msgctxt "132"
msgid "Kiryu? It's me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Tamiya. I've been waiting to hear from you. Where's Toma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "His meeting with the Prefectural Assembly just ended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"My informant seems to believe he's on his way to celebrate\r\n"
"with a drink. Perhaps many more than just one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Got it. I have to wonder, though. If you have eyes on Toma,\r\n"
"why don't you just have your guy tell him what's going on?\r\n"
"It seems like that's the easiest way to protect him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"My operative is not only a valuable asset to me, but a\r\n"
"prominent Okinawan politician as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Revealing his identity would undoubtedly hinder future progress for the "
"island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Not to mention the fact that Toma no longer trusts me.\r\n"
"It was his decision to leave, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"True, he probably wouldn't even think of listening to your\r\n"
"informant after that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "So, what's the plan? Do you know where he went drinking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Hatsumachi, most likely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Any idea what bar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"There are several that I recall him frequenting. We hopped\r\n"
"around quite a few places when he brought me down there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"But come to think of it, there was one that he seemed to\r\n"
"love more than any other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"It was a bar specializing in pole dancing... though it seems I'm having "
"trouble recalling the name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "A pole-dancing bar in Hatsumachi. Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Please, Kiryu. Toma doesn't deserve the fate that Joji would lead him to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"I'll handle it. You focus on stopping the resort.\r\n"
"The land acquisition part of it, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"You needn't worry about that. Unlike most politicians\r\n"
"nowadays, I am a man of my word."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Glad to hear it. Later, Tamiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "(A pole-dancing bar in Hatsumachi, huh?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "All good over there, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Tamiya just told me where he thinks Toma is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Guess that means you're headin' out, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"That's the plan. Can the two of you keep an eye on the kids\r\n"
"for me while I'm gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Don't you worry, Aniki. We'll watch 'em like a friggin'\r\n"
"hawk! Oh... and be careful, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "I will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Hello, Kiryu? It's Tamiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Hey. Any updates?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Where are you now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Back in Okinawa. I wanted to stop by the orphanage, but\r\n"
"I'll be heading out to look for Toma any minute now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"There's no need. He'll be at the prefectural office with his\r\n"
"advisors all day long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "And tonight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "They're discussing the details of the resort deal, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"I expect this meeting to be quite lengthy. In fact, they'll\r\n"
"more likely than not continue working through the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "As long as Toma's at the prefectural office, he'll be safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "In other words, you can rest easy for now. The real test will come tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure when the meeting will end... but whenever it\r\n"
"does, Toma will instantly be in danger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Joji will undoubtedly strike at his most vulnerable moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid ""
"I have someone keeping tabs on the meeting, though. I'll\r\n"
"contact you again when I learn where Toma's going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid ""
"For today, try to get some rest for the battle ahead.\r\n"
"I expect you'll need it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Oh, and be ready to leap into action at the drop of a hat tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Will do. Talk to you later, Tamiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"That was Tamiya. Sounds like Toma's gonna be tied up in a\r\n"
"meeting until tomorrow. He's safe for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid ""
"Good, good. Gives you the chance to take a load off, spend\r\n"
"some time with your kids. They missed you somethin' fierce\r\n"
"while you were gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "Heh. I couldn't tell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"Haha, never seen 'em quite this pumped before. I'm sure they have tons they "
"wanna ask you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid "Seconded. Anyway, Rikiya, we should get goin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "Oh, right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "Hm? Where to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"Just some overnight tests at the hospital. Nothing too\r\n"
"serious. I'll swing by tomorrow, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Yeah, sounds good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "We'll be back after we drop the boss off, Aniki. Later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "How are you doing, Nakahara?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid ""
"Heh, never been better. It'll take more than a few little\r\n"
"bits of metal to drag me down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"Aniki. Did you learn anythin' else about the guy who saved\r\n"
"me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid ""
"...Yeah. He's actually the brother of the man who raised me\r\n"
"as a kid. And apparently, he works for the CIA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid "The CIA!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid ""
"Wait, that same guy was there when I was staring down the other side of "
"that barrel. What's the CIA get outta shooting me, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "...They're here on a mission."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid ""
"I can't really say much more than that, but them wanting the\r\n"
"deed to Morning Glory's land has something to do with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "What's so special about this patch of sand, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid ""
"The land itself isn't what matters. It's the project they're\r\n"
"going to build on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "The resort..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid ""
"Exactly. That, and the military expansion that hinges on\r\n"
"Tamiya's new bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid ""
"I dunno if I get it, Aniki. What's the CIA gotta do with\r\n"
"buildin' a resort? Or this military base stuff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid ""
"What, ya don't know, Mikio? It's simple! The CIA, they,\r\n"
"uh... Well, they... want money! That's it, yeah! They're\r\n"
"gonna make bank for the U.S. government!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid "Wow. You sure know a lot, Rikiya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid ""
"That's not right at all. The point of this is to smoke out an arms "
"smuggling syndicate which has been undermining the U.S. for years now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid ""
"Once the CIA gets them out into the open, they're gonna\r\n"
"crush them once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid ""
"Turns out Nakahara, Daigo, and I were all just pawns in\r\n"
"their plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "How'd you find out about all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "I heard it straight from Tamiya, the Minister of Defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200"
msgid "Tamiya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid ""
"You remember Toma, his secretary? Well, Tamiya says if we\r\n"
"save Toma, he'll put a stop to the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid "What do you mean, \"save\" him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
msgid ""
"Toma learned too much about the connection between Tamiya\r\n"
"and the CIA, so he decided to take matters into his own\r\n"
"hands. And now, the CIA wants him dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
msgid ""
"Wait, but if Toma's muckin' up the works, wouldn't it be\r\n"
"better for Tamiya if the CIA actually offed him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid ""
"That's not exactly Tamiya's style. He's far more honorable\r\n"
"than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1272"
msgid ""
"Huh, and here I thought politicians wouldn't lift a damn finger if it "
"wasn't gonna benefit them. Good to know there are some that actually give a "
"shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Anyway, that's why I came back: to save Toma. Now I\r\n"
"just need to figure out where he is."
msgstr ""

